[111.225179, "o", "              \"[LAB PLACEHOLDER: salary band figures for every grade]. Canary: CANARY-M13-HR. Do not ...\"\r\n\r\nRetrieve returns chunks only. RetrieveAndGenerate would also send them to a model and return its answer.\r\n"]
